/-
D63 lane L61 (2026-11-13), part 3: **explicit adversary-free block slot polynomials (`bwFsl`, `bwFslRun`) over `dArgs`
and their `SlotEvalN` proofs (`bwFsl_slotEvalN`, `bwFslRun_slotEvalN`), plus automatic Shieldstral layer synthesis**.

`dArgs` packages the four decoded matrices that `csArgs` reads (`bndTab` on `A`, `H`, and the header entries at `pi`,
`po`), so `csArgs_dArgs` holds directly by `claimSem_cast_lc`. Combining `Block.polyS_slotEvalN`, `Block.maskedF_slotEvalN`,
and `Link.msXof_mlin` discharges `hsl_argsN` completely, and `ShieldRunAt` supplies every layer's verified `progR13`
and mask-row bounds automatically (`shieldRunProg`, `shieldRunPubs`, `shieldRun_hdef`, `shieldRun_hprog`, `shieldRun_hN`).

Generated by `results/zk60_lean_l61_20261113/l61_mk_wire.py`. Only `propext`, `Classical.choice`, `Quot.sound`.
-/
